{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash the Cache is a lighthearted roguelite. Steal everything you can! Escape, buy upgrades, and steal again, but this time, more! How far can you take it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good ole fun ;)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is stealable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around the map and choose any house based on its level. Procedural generation allows you to explore and loot new houses again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the store after you loot to buy more upgrades and become better thief.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704870?t=1749406254","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704870/315f6e1265e24b2bae0d326f8c170e91b498192c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749406254","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704870/8c841961a0de20b519ae9bbff5e0c716ff4c672f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749406254","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704870/8c841961a0de20b519ae9bbff5e0c716ff4c672f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749406254","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash the Cache is a lighthearted roguelite. Steal ever